        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Cross Dock Prompt",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const crossDockSuggestionsCount =\n  $context?.$nodes?.LINES_TOPUTAWAY_WITHCROSSDOCK?.$output?.count ?? 0;\n\nconst prompt = `\n<crossDockSuggestionsCount>${crossDockSuggestionsCount}</crossDockSuggestionsCount>\n\nTask:\n- If crossDockSuggestionsCount > 0, generate exactly ONE \"message widget list row\" for Cross Dock Suggestions.\n- The title should clearly indicate Cross Dock suggestions and MUST include the count (${crossDockSuggestionsCount}), but the exact wording is flexible.\n- If crossDockSuggestionsCount = 0, return empty output (no row, no text).\n\nDescription requirements (when count > 0):\n- Use clear, concise, and user-friendly language.\n- Clearly indicate that cross dock opportunities are available and actionable.\n- Keep it short and suitable for a single list row.\n- Optionally mention what the suggestions relate to (e.g., putaway lines, items, or shipments) if relevant.\n\nAction:\nora.Agent({\n  \"command\": \"showDetailedInfoOnCrossDockOptions\",\n  \"subAgent\": \"INV_WH_OPS_INBOUND_CROSSDOCK_ADVISOR\",\n  \"agent\": \"INV_WH_OPS_INBOUND_ADVISOR\"\n})\n\n- No additional Actions\n\n\n`.trim();\n\nreturn prompt;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "CROSS_DOCK_PROMPT",
          "id": "1771211787305",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE",
          "diagram": {
