        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "CrunchDown Information Node",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const crunchReceivingData = (\n  linesToPutawayResponse,\n  putawaySuggestionsResponse,\n  shipmentLinesResponse\n) => {\n\n  const receipts =\n    linesToPutawayResponse && linesToPutawayResponse.items\n      ? linesToPutawayResponse.items\n      : [];\n\n  const suggestions =\n    putawaySuggestionsResponse && putawaySuggestionsResponse.items\n      ? putawaySuggestionsResponse.items\n      : [];\n\n  const shipmentLines =\n    shipmentLinesResponse && shipmentLinesResponse.items\n      ? shipmentLinesResponse.items\n      : [];\n\n  /* ---------------------------------------------\n     Build Shipment Line Lookup\n  ---------------------------------------------- */\n  const shipmentMap = {};\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < shipmentLines.length; i++) {\n    const line = shipmentLines[i];\n\n    shipmentMap[line.Order] = {\n      salesOrder: line.Order,\n      salesOrderLine: line.OrderLine,\n      customer: line.ShipToCustomer,\n      requestedQty: line.RequestedQuantity,\n      pendingQty: line.PendingQuantity,\n      uom: line.RequestedQuantityUOM,\n      status: line.LineStatus,\n      shipToCity: line.ShipToCity,\n      shipToState: line.ShipToState,\n      scheduledShipDate: line.ScheduledShipDate,\n      shipToCustomer: line.ShipToCustomer\n    };\n  }\n\n  /* ---------------------------------------------\n     Group Cross Dock Suggestions by ParentTransactionId\n  ---------------------------------------------- */\n  const crossDockByParentTxn = {};\n\n  for (let j = 0; j < suggestions.length; j++) {\n    const s = suggestions[j];\n    const parentTxnId = s.ParentTransactionId;\n\n    if (!parentTxnId) continue;\n\n    if (!crossDockByParentTxn[parentTxnId]) {\n      crossDockByParentTxn[parentTxnId] = [];\n    }\n\n    crossDockByParentTxn[parentTxnId].push(s);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------------------------------------------\n     Flatten Output\n  ---------------------------------------------- */\n  const result = [];\n\n  for (let r = 0; r < receipts.length; r++) {\n    const receipt = receipts[r];\n    const parentId = receipt.TransactionId;\n    const matchedSuggestions =\n      crossDockByParentTxn[parentId]\n        ? crossDockByParentTxn[parentId]\n        : [];\n\n    // No suggestions → still return one row\n    if (matchedSuggestions.length === 0) {\n      result.push({\n        receiptTransactionId: receipt.TransactionId,\n        receiptNumber: receipt.ReceiptNumber,\n        documentNumber: receipt.DocumentNumber,\n        documentType: receipt.DocumentType,\n        lineNumber: receipt.LineNumber,\n        itemNumber: receipt.ItemNumber,\n        organization: receipt.ToOrganizationCode,\n        supplier: receipt.SupplierName,\n        receiptQty: receipt.Quantity,\n        receiptUom: receipt.UnitOfMeasure,\n        crossDockSuggestionId: null,\n        crossDockRank: null,\n        crossDockSalesOrder: null,\n        crossDockSalesOrderLine: null\n      });\n    } else {\n\n      for (let k = 0; k < matchedSuggestions.length; k++) {\n        const cd = matchedSuggestions[k];\n        const shipmentInfo =\n          shipmentMap[cd.CrossDockOrderNumber]\n            ? shipmentMap[cd.CrossDockOrderNumber]\n            : {};\n\n        result.push({\n          receiptTransactionId: receipt.TransactionId,\n          receiptNumber: receipt.ReceiptNumber,\n          documentNumber: receipt.DocumentNumber,\n          documentType: receipt.DocumentType,\n          lineNumber: receipt.LineNumber,\n          itemNumber: receipt.ItemNumber,\n          organization: receipt.ToOrganizationCode,\n          supplier: receipt.SupplierName,\n          receiptQty: receipt.Quantity,\n          receiptUom: receipt.UnitOfMeasure,\n\n          crossDockSuggestionId: cd.SuggestionId,\n          crossDockRank: cd.SuggestionRank,\n          crossDockSalesOrder: cd.CrossDockOrderNumber,\n          crossDockSalesOrderLine: cd.CrossDockOrderLineNumber,\n          putAwaySuggestionId: cd.PutAwaySuggestionId,\n          salesOrder: shipmentInfo.salesOrder || null,\n          salesOrderLine: shipmentInfo.salesOrderLine || null,\n          customer: shipmentInfo.customer || null,\n          requestedQty: shipmentInfo.requestedQty || null,\n          pendingQty: shipmentInfo.pendingQty || null,\n          uom: shipmentInfo.uom || null,\n          status: shipmentInfo.status || null,\n          shipToCity: shipmentInfo.shipToCity || null,\n          shipToState: shipmentInfo.shipToState || null,\n          scheduledShipDate: shipmentInfo.scheduledShipDate,\n          shipToCustomer: shipmentInfo.shipToCustomer\n        });\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  return result;\n};\n\n\n/* ===========================\n   Usage\n=========================== */\n\nconst compactData = crunchReceivingData(\n  $context.$nodes.LINES_TO_PUTAWAY.$output,\n  $context.$nodes.LINES_TO_PUTAWAY_SUGGESTIONS.$output,\n  $context.$nodes.SHIPMENT_LINES_RECORDS_FETCH.$output\n);\n\nreturn compactData;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771390498744"
          },
          "code": "CRUNCHDOWN_INFORMATION_NODE",
          "id": "1771402782176",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5928.5,
            "y": 6538
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prompt For Widget",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let prompt = `\n<putawayRecordsWithCrossDockSuggestions> ${JSON.stringify($context.$nodes.CRUNCHDOWN_INFORMATION_NODE.$output.result)} </putawayRecordsWithCrossDockSuggestions>\n\nGenerate a multiRecordWidget displaying the putaway suggestions.\nIf there are multiple suggestions, present them in a flat table format.\nIt's acceptable to repeat the parent record for each suggestion to ensure each row is complete and unambiguous.\n\nFor each row generate an action \nUse this actionable command format: Action title should be 'Execute'\nora.Agent({\n  \"command\": \"executeCrossDock\",\n  \"subAgent\": \"INV_WH_OPS_INBOUND_CROSSDOCK_ADVISOR\",\n  \"agent\": \"INV_WH_OPS_INBOUND_ADVISOR\",\n   \"parameters\" : \"<Parameters JSON>\"\n})\n\nparameters:  {\"ReceiptNumber\": \"<receiptNumber>\", \"parentTransactionId\": \"<parentTransactionId>\", \"crossDockOrderNumber\": \"<Cross Dock Order Number>\",\"crossDockLineNumber\":\"Cross Dock Line Number\", \"PutAwaySuggestionId\": \"putAwaySuggestionId\" }\n\n\nTitle should be 'Cross Docking Suggestions'\n\nShow following columns in this particular order\nReceipt Number\nDocumentNumber as 'Source Document Number'\nItem Number\nQuantity with Unit of Measure, Heading should be 'Quantity'\nOrder Type (Sales order or Transfer Order)\nCustomer name\nCross dock Order Number\nCross dock document \nShipment Date as 'Shipment Date' in just Date format\n\n\n\n`;\n\n\nreturn prompt;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "PROMPT_FOR_WIDGET",
          "id": "1771390498744",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE",
          "diagram": {
